  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chicken jalfrezi is a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "dry curry",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dry-curry"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " cooked fast over high heat. The chicken goes in with the onion and pepper, the sauce is formed by the tomatoes and onion cooking down, and the result is a concentrated, slightly charred, spiced dish with visible chunks of vegetable. It takes 20 minutes start to finish. Do not reduce the heat once the chicken is in: the high heat is what gives jalfrezi its characteristic slightly smoky edge."
          }
        ]
      },
